<PageLayout title="Information for parents and carers" lede="What to expect, how we communicate, and how your child's information is looked after.">
  <h2>Before the first session</h2>
  <p>We start with a free consultation, where you can ask questions and we agree goals.</p>
  <h2>During tuition</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Sessions are online. For students under 18, a parent or carer should be at home.</li>
    <li>You can ask for a short progress summary after any session.</li>
    <li>Read the <a href="/tutoring/safeguarding/">safeguarding statement</a>, <a href="/tutoring/privacy/">privacy notice</a> and <a href="/tutoring/cancellations/">cancellation policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <BookingCTA />
</PageLayout>
